@startuml
[*] --> CreateUser : createAccount
CreateUser --> Login : loginAttempt
Login --> CheckWeather : checkWeather
CheckWeather --> ViewDetails : viewDetails
ViewDetails --> Logout : logoutRequest
Logout --> Success : logoutComplete
Success --> [*] : processComplete

CreateUser --> Failure : registrationFailed
Failure --> [*] : failureProcessComplete
@enduml
